src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.3cee31a93bcf5d11:
This 2021 Alfa Romeo Giulia came to our workshop in Belgrade for a scheduled service. We went beyond a simple oil change, replacing the routine service items and servicing the automatic transmission at the same time.

What we did:

- replaced the spark plugs;
- changed the engine oil;
- replaced the oil filter;
- replaced the air filter;
- replaced the cabin filter;
- fitted a new automatic transmission sump;
- changed the fluid in the ZF 8HP automatic transmission.

The transmission received some extra attention. On **ZF 8HP** automatics, it is important to monitor the condition of the fluid and sump and keep up with servicing. Timely maintenance costs considerably less than a transmission repair.

src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.df496a49dc536c51:
Alfa Romeo Giulia iz 2021. godine stigla je kod nas u Beograd na redovan servis. Odlučili smo da se ne zadržimo samo na zameni ulja: proverili smo sav potrošni materijal i ujedno uradili servis automatskog menjača.

Šta smo uradili:

- zamenili svećice;
- zamenili motorno ulje;
- zamenili filter ulja;
- zamenili filter vazduha;
- zamenili filter kabine;
- zamenili kompletan karter automatskog menjača;
- zamenili ulje u automatskom menjaču ZF 8HP.

Posebnu pažnju posvetili smo menjaču. Kod automatskih menjača **ZF 8HP** važno je pratiti stanje ulja i kartera i ne odlagati servis: pravovremeno održavanje menjača znatno je jeftinije od njegove popravke.

src/content/works/audi-q7/index.md.07f7aaa5d06a761f:
This 2008 Audi Q7 came to us with a long list of faults. Both the suspension and the engine needed serious attention.

Work carried out:

- replaced the suspension arms;
- replaced the brake discs and pads;
- carried out work in the engine valley;
- resealed the intake system;
- replaced the EGR pipe;
- carried out an interim service, including an oil and filter change.

A separate issue was a persistent engine oil leak. The drain plug had been fitted incorrectly during a previous service, leaving oil constantly dripping from the engine. We fixed the problem and put everything right.

The first-generation Audi Q7 needs knowledgeable care, especially as these cars get older and cover more miles. The key is to find out why a fault has developed and address the root cause, rather than simply fit a new part.

src/content/works/audi-q7/index.md.f03f8ef1d1b6d511:
Kod nas je stigao Audi Q7 iz 2008. godine sa podužim spiskom kvarova. Automobilu su bili potrebni ozbiljniji radovi i na trapu i na motoru.

Šta je urađeno:

- zamena ramena ogibljenja;
- zamena kočionih diskova i pločica;
- radovi u prostoru između glava motora;
- zamena zaptivki usisnog sistema;
- zamena EGR cevi;
- mali servis sa zamenom ulja i filtera.

Poseban problem bilo je stalno curenje motornog ulja. Prilikom prethodnog servisa čep za ispuštanje ulja nije bio pravilno postavljen, pa je ulje neprestano kapalo iz motora. Otklonili smo problem i sve doveli u red.

Audi Q7 prve generacije zahteva stručno održavanje, naročito kada je reč o starijim primercima sa velikom kilometražom. Važno je utvrditi zbog čega je kvar nastao i otkloniti uzrok, a ne samo ugraditi novi deo.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.06946ca66b21be0d:
This Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 came to our workshop in Belgrade for a minor service.

We carried out:

- an engine oil change;
- an oil filter replacement;
- an engine air filter replacement;
- a cabin filter replacement;
- replacement of the front and rear brake pads;
- a brake system inspection and service.

A closer look at the brakes. Brake pads are critical to safety and need regular checks. Whenever we replace the pads, we also check the **discs, calipers and slide pins**. If any of these are seized or worn, the brakes can apply unevenly.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.5923301987fecfa5:
Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 stigao je u naš auto servis u Beogradu na mali servis.

Uradili smo:

- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu filtera ulja;
- zamenu filtera vazduha motora;
- zamenu filtera kabine;
- zamenu svih kočionih pločica;
- servis i proveru kočionog sistema.

Posebnu pažnju posvetili smo kočnicama. Kočione pločice su jedan od ključnih elemenata bezbednosti i njihovo stanje treba redovno proveravati. Prilikom zamene pločica uvek proveravamo i **diskove, kočiona klešta i vođice**: ako je neki od ovih delova zapekao ili istrošen, automobil neće ravnomerno kočiti.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.15e601fafbfeb290:
MINI Cooper SD sa dizel motorom **2.0 B47 od 170 KS** stigao je u naš auto servis u Beogradu na kompletan servis.

Uradili smo:

- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu svih filtera;
- zamenu filtera goriva;
- zamenu ulja u osmostepenom automatskom menjaču Aisin;
- kompjutersku dijagnostiku motora i elektronskih sistema;
- dijagnostiku usisnog sistema.

Filter goriva na dizel motoru treba menjati najmanje jednom na **20.000 km**. Tako se štiti sistem za gorivo i obezbeđuje pravilan rad motora.

Prilikom provere usisa otkrili smo velike naslage nečistoća: vrtložne klapne bile su prekrivene debelim slojem čađi i gareži. Predložili smo vlasniku čišćenje, on je pristao i temeljno smo očistili ceo usis.

Dizel motor B47 u vozilima BMW i MINI, automatski menjač Aisin i usisni sistem traže redovno održavanje: pravovremenu zamenu ulja i filtera, kao i povremenu proveru stanja usisa. Tako se skupe popravke mogu odložiti na duže vreme.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.a25f351e7559408e:
This MINI Cooper SD with a **170 hp 2.0 B47 diesel engine** came to our workshop in Belgrade for a comprehensive service.

We carried out:

- an engine oil change;
- replacement of all filters;
- fuel filter replacement;
- an oil change for the 8-speed Aisin automatic transmission;
- a diagnostic scan of the engine and electronic systems;
- an inspection of the intake system.

On a diesel, the fuel filter should be replaced at least every **20,000 km** to protect the fuel system and keep the engine running smoothly.

The intake inspection revealed heavy contamination: the swirl flaps were coated in a thick layer of soot and carbon deposits. We recommended cleaning the intake, the owner agreed, and we cleaned it thoroughly.

The B47 diesel used in BMW and MINI models, the Aisin automatic transmission and the intake system all benefit from regular maintenance: change the oil and filters on time and keep an eye on the intake's condition. This helps keep expensive repairs at bay.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.0261abf2b106ea9d:
A car came into our workshop in Belgrade with **vibration under braking**: whenever the driver pressed the brake pedal, the car would start shaking.

We started by checking the wheel balance. Wheel imbalance is a common cause of vibration and one of the easiest to rule out. The balance was fine, so we moved on to the braking system.

At first glance, the discs and pads looked fine, with no obvious signs of excessive wear. A closer inspection revealed that **the left brake disc was warped**. This was what was causing the vibration.

We showed the customer the problem and got approval for the repairs. Here is what we did:

- inspected the braking system;
- checked and balanced the wheels;
- identified warping in the left brake disc;
- replaced the brake discs;
- replaced the brake pads;
- rechecked the wheel balance;
- carried out a road test after the repairs.

The vibration under braking was completely gone. After the final checks, we handed the car back to its owner.

A brake disc can look perfectly normal and still be warped. You cannot always spot this kind of distortion by eye. So if you notice the steering wheel shaking, the brake pedal pulsing or the car vibrating when you brake, it is best not to put off having it checked.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.27fa482a78e2fab8:
U naš auto servis u Beogradu stigao je automobil zbog **vibracija pri kočenju**: kada vozač pritisne papučicu kočnice, automobil počinje da se trese.

Počeli smo od provere balansa točkova. Neizbalansirani točkovi su najčešći uzrok ovakvih vibracija i to je najlakše prvo isključiti. Balans je bio u redu, pa smo nastavili sa proverom kočionog sistema.

Na prvi pogled diskovi i pločice bili su u dobrom stanju, bez očiglednih znakova većeg habanja. Detaljnom proverom utvrdili smo da je **levi kočioni disk deformisan**. Upravo je on izazivao vibracije.

Pokazali smo vlasniku u čemu je problem i dogovorili popravku. Šta smo uradili:

- dijagnostiku kočionog sistema;
- proveru i balansiranje točkova;
- utvrđivanje deformacije levog kočionog diska;
- zamenu kočionih diskova;
- zamenu kočionih pločica;
- ponovnu proveru balansa točkova;
- probnu vožnju nakon popravke.

Nakon toga vibracije pri kočenju potpuno su nestale. Automobil smo proverili i predali vlasniku.

Disk može da izgleda sasvim dobro, a da ipak bude iskrivljen. Takva deformacija ne može da se uoči golim okom. Zato, ako primetite podrhtavanje volana, vibracije papučice ili karoserije pri kočenju, nemojte odlagati dijagnostiku.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.4ba40faf00eac809:
This 2024 Peugeot 308 with a **1.5 BlueHDi** diesel engine came to our Russian-speaking garage in Belgrade for a major service. We carried out the full job:

- timing belt replacement;
- water pump replacement;
- coolant replacement;
- engine oil change;
- filter replacement;
- inspection and servicing of all related components.

The 1.5 BlueHDi has one particular issue worth highlighting: the camshaft drive chain. Early versions of this engine used a **7 mm** chain. Over time, it can stretch and, in the worst case, break, causing catastrophic engine damage.

When servicing these engines, the recommendation is to fit the upgraded **8 mm** chain, along with the camshaft carrier and the camshafts themselves. The 2023–2024 Peugeot 308 already has the 8 mm chain fitted from the factory.

So a major service should cover more than just the timing belt. It is also important to check the camshaft chain and take account of the known issues specific to the engine.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.bac6347178dd978e:
Peugeot 308 iz 2024. godine sa dizel motorom **1.5 BlueHDi** stigao je u naš ruski auto servis u Beogradu na veliki servis. Obavili smo kompletan servis:

- zamena zupčastog kaiša;
- zamena pumpe za vodu;
- zamena antifriza;
- zamena motornog ulja;
- zamena filtera;
- provera i servisiranje svih pratećih komponenti.

Motor 1.5 BlueHDi ima jednu specifičnost na koju treba posebno obratiti pažnju: lanac koji povezuje bregaste osovine. U ranije verzije ovog motora ugrađivan je lanac širine **7 mm**. Vremenom se isteže, a u najgorem slučaju može da pukne i izazove teško oštećenje motora.

Prilikom servisiranja ovih motora preporučuje se ugradnja ojačanog lanca širine **8 mm**, zajedno sa kućištem bregastih osovina i samim bregastim osovinama. Peugeot 308 iz 2023. i 2024. godine već fabrički ima lanac od 8 mm.

Zato pri velikom servisu ne treba proveravati samo zupčasti kaiš već i lanac bregastih osovina, uz obraćanje pažnje na sve poznate specifičnosti konkretnog motora.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.7bd3c63fd8edd571:
Seat Leon sa **190 000 km** na satu stigao je u naš ruski auto servis u Beogradu na redovno održavanje većeg obima, poznato kao veliki servis.

Na ovoj kilometraži najbolje je odjednom servisirati ključne sklopove, pa smo uradili sledeće:

- zamenu kompleta zupčastog remena;
- zamenu pumpe za vodu;
- zamenu antifriza;
- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu svih potrebnih filtera;
- zamenu zadnjih amortizera;
- zamenu ulja u DSG DQ250 menjaču.

Za vozila marki Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda i Audi veliki servis je ključan deo održavanja. Pravovremena zamena zupčastog remena, pumpe za vodu, radnih tečnosti i potrošnih delova sprečava mnogo skuplje probleme kasnije.

Posebna napomena za **DQ250**. To je šestostepeni menjač sa dvostrukim kvačilom u uljnom kupatilu, u kome se ulje mora menjati prema propisanom servisnom intervalu. Redovna zamena ulja ključna je za njegov pouzdan rad.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.cf29214c0d8f2ab1:
This Seat Leon came to our Russian-speaking garage in Belgrade with **190,000 km** on the clock for a scheduled major service.

At this mileage, it makes sense to service the key components together, so we carried out:

- timing belt kit replacement;
- water pump replacement;
- coolant replacement;
- engine oil change;
- replacement of all required filters;
- rear shock absorber replacement;
- DSG DQ250 gearbox oil change.

For Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda and Audi models, a major service is a key maintenance milestone. Replacing the timing belt, water pump, fluids and service parts on time helps prevent much more expensive problems down the line.

A separate note on the **DQ250**. This is a six-speed dual-clutch gearbox with wet clutches, and its oil needs to be changed at the specified intervals. Regular oil changes are essential to keeping it running reliably.
